[{"client_msg_id":"3d62a923-89c5-471e-bd74-c93e07251c2b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"update ちゃんと無事終わった。忍耐強く待っててよかった (フリーズだと思って強制終了する場合がある)","ts":"1615371464.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZiGoX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5618a294-17c8-423f-9648-26452cbf831e","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"昔はHDDアクセスランプと音で大体分かったけど最近は付いてない事もあるからなぁ…","ts":"1615371370.038400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/+3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e55df423-d471-43da-ae4b-00ea516bf1bd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、でも今 30% 完了になったので一応進行はしてるっぽい。もっとちゃんと進捗表示してくれないとフリーズしているようにしか見えない","ts":"1615371196.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HRXz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"733f81ca-1403-4e80-877f-ba813608a18e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"グルグルしっぱなしなので何も確認できない…","ts":"1615371127.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tva"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0317cb8a-9d0d-478c-b40a-a8ec0e97d382","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自宅だとオプションだから入ってないで待機してるなあ","ts":"1615371053.036600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fa+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0959dd60-c976-4b9c-93f0-5cb0bf4dbf1d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"KB4601382 これかしらん?","ts":"1615370808.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOl3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d42e348-e115-467d-a08f-cd53872a9a08","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"20H2 とかに更新ですか？","ts":"1615370668.035700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eR=1g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc984587-55ce-465b-b818-ab92f5157646","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Windows Update で再起動かけたら「Windows の準備をしています 電源を切らないでください」でずっとグルグルして先に進まないやつに遭遇してしまった","ts":"1615370520.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gIR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a21dab0-7502-4cc3-acf3-f7736b84556d","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"MSVC でビルドしたファイルも msys2 上で実行すると、行番号が表示されなかった。PATH が何か悪さしてるのかな？","ts":"1615364232.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ds+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74a581a8-b96c-4772-bf01-e88dfddb6e73","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"msys2 の clang + lld を使うとデバッグシンボルは実行ファイルに埋め込まれるのに…。どうなっているのやら？","ts":"1615363101.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4SXTo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5930ef6-9c21-4e0b-ae73-20464ffdec2e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"lld を使ってもデバッグシンボルは .pdb 形式で出力されてる。","ts":"1615363031.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iJ/P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d9b30e9-800d-428e-a1ab-7922001fda9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":hee:","ts":"1615362253.029600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xe=4B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1b1e7be-f1f8-48ee-a6ce-d8acdad66331","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"しかし、できたプログラムを msys2 上から実行したら asan で行番号が表示されなかった。謎。","ts":"1615361989.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qTe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46d42f7a-74a1-4129-bfc8-cdc8e5dcfc72","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"clang で `-g` を付けてデバッグシンボルを有効にしたはずなのに、asan のログでソースの行番号などが表示されず変だなと思ったら、clang はデフォルトだと MSVC のリンカを使ってた。`-fuse-ld=lld` を付けて lld を使ってリンクして、できたプログラムをコマンドプロンプトから実行したら、asan で行番号が表示された。","ts":"1615361927.028000","edited":{"user":"U6XP9LZ6V","ts":"1615362122.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i0s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c622d95-133e-43e5-acd0-841cbf84cd2e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"あー、\u003chttp://llvm.org|llvm.org\u003e から LLVM/Clang 11.0.0 の公式インストーラーを取ってきてインストールしたら、asan のライブラリも入ってて asan を有効にしてビルドできた。MSYS2 の clang で使えないのは、MSYS2 のパッケージングの問題っぽい。","ts":"1615359363.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8JB="}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5edb72f-5e90-4452-bcc2-1c2b9fdcd2ec","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Python2まだ供養できてないのがいっぱいあるなぁ...みんな苦しんでるイメージしかない","ts":"1615355318.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"48YST"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b443ba5a-78fc-487a-b30a-0eec9fe9a1ec","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"cygwin の mercurial が python3 を使うように更新されてました。","ts":"1615355043.020600","thread_ts":"1614910361.007700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","UD1FQV38V","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PBg"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"e7ce1c6b-f52d-4b28-b48a-c46a5e7dea60","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"mercurial自体は（確か去年のうちに）python2に対応していますが、cygwinのmercurialパッケージがpython2でビルドされたまま…","ts":"1614910361.007700","thread_ts":"1614910361.007700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bR6sa"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"af722509-3a1b-479b-8433-30294c51ec27","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"wikipedia早いな。もうMSVCの話が載ってる。","ts":"1615353654.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TkT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"068eb763-53be-493e-abb8-2a6b019ee671","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"MSYS2のclang 11.0だとasanを有効にしようとするとリンクエラー。\n```C:\\msys64\\mingw64\\bin\\ld: cannot find C:\\msys64\\mingw64\\lib\\clang\\11.0.0\\lib\\windows\\libclang_rt.asan_dynamic-x86_64.dll.a: No such file or directory\nC:\\msys64\\mingw64\\bin\\ld: cannot find C:\\msys64\\mingw64\\lib\\clang\\11.0.0\\lib\\windows\\libclang_rt.asan_dynamic_runtime_thunk-x86_64.a: No such file or directory\nC:\\msys64\\mingw64\\bin\\ld: cannot find C:\\msys64\\mingw64\\lib\\clang\\11.0.0\\lib\\windows\\libclang_rt.asan_dynamic_runtime_thunk-x86_64.a: No such file or directory\nclang: error: linker command failed with exit code 1 (use -v to see invocation)```","ts":"1615353603.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/MJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78077a43-e0cf-47e8-a242-2ea0aea6cd9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AddressSanitizer\u003e\n命名はGoogle?","ts":"1615353378.018200","thread_ts":"1615345588.010600","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: AddressSanitizer","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"AddressSanitizer","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AddressSanitizer","text":"AddressSanitizer (or ASan) is an open source programming tool by Google that detects memory corruption bugs such as buffer overflows or accesses to a dangling pointer (use-after-free). AddressSanitizer is based on compiler instrumentation and directly-mapped shadow memory. \nAddressSanitizer is currently implemented in Clang (starting from version 3.1) , GCC (starting from version 4.8), Xcode (starting from version 7.0) and MSVC (widely available starting from version 16.9) . On average, the instrumentation increases processing time by about 73% and memory usage by 240%.","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AddressSanitizer","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AddressSanitizer"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C6TEAZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NinqQ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"3d15ccff-569d-4d09-87f7-2b1ce5f20aab","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それ sanitizer という名前でいいのかという疑問。","ts":"1615345588.010600","thread_ts":"1615345588.010600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+O"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"8b7d7ca6-b0cd-43b9-b482-cd48b9b781f6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ほー","ts":"1615353295.018100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X6mK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f7ceeba-71d8-4b30-907a-912e80208239","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`/MD` なしだとasanもスタティックリンクされるみたい。","ts":"1615353139.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1faUo"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`/MD` でコンパイルすると、asanのdllからいくつか関数をインポートしているのが見えます。","ts":"1615353076.017300","files":[{"id":"F01R3SJH9R7","created":1615353066,"timestamp":1615353066,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":17348,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01R3SJH9R7/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01R3SJH9R7/download/image.png","origi