al":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aPo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27140d32-7236-4eb4-9347-eb5b8843a9f2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"asanってコンパイラレベルなのかしら? それともリンクレベルなの?","ts":"1615352581.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Ek"}]},{"client_msg_id":"138535a0-a831-47b6-9e00-e73869132bf0","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"以前のMSのブログには、成果はclangにも還元していると書いてあったから、そのうちWindows版のclangでもasanが使えるようになるのだろうか？","ts":"1615352005.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YVxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"313f3b25-1cb3-458e-a6b8-0a20840bb054","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Vim のソースビルドしたらいっぱいひっかかりそう。","ts":"1615351993.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O5bq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e97d7245-a4f3-4a1c-8c0d-e116f1da2742","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"v16.9.1に更新して、`cl hoge.c /fsanitize=address` と実行したら、 `ASan エラー報告を向上させるには、デバッグ情報を有効にしてください` と言われた。\nで、`cl hoge.c /fsanitize=address /Zi` としたら、warning も消えてリンクも完了。以前みたいに asan のライブラリを明示的に指定する必要がなくなったのはよい。","ts":"1615351857.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nrWH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"608b2f01-f6fa-4336-b96c-452a2f103d7b","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"アドレスは消毒だ～(AAry","ts":"1615351483.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zesh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d15ccff-569d-4d09-87f7-2b1ce5f20aab","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それ sanitizer という名前でいいのかという疑問。","ts":"1615345588.010600","thread_ts":"1615345588.010600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f616f903-4806-4cd6-96e5-67dfe7f43cf2","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Linda_pp/status/1369471126204649473\u003e","ts":"1615342964.010100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Linda_pp|@Linda_pp\u003e: Visual Studio 2019 v16.9 で address sanitizer (asan) がフルサポートされた (/fsanitize=address)．試験実装として元々入っていたのが安定版になった \u003chttps://devblogs.microsoft.com/cppblog/address-sanitizer-for-msvc-now-generally-available/\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"ドッグ","author_subname":"@Linda_pp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Linda_pp/status/1369471126204649473","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/736944193059229697/cjVzDlPe_normal.jpg","text":"Visual Studio 2019 v16.9 で address sanitizer (asan) がフルサポートされた (/fsanitize=address)．試験実装として元々入っていたのが安定版になった \u003chttps://devblogs.microsoft.com/cppblog/address-sanitizer-for-msvc-now-generally-available/\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1615342334,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Linda_pp/status/1369471126204649473","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Linda_pp/status/1369471126204649473"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8k"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"\u003c@U01PMN2BVJQ\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1615342821.009900","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
